{"id":"frechheit","lemma":"Frechheit","pos":"noun","rank":4979,"glosses":["insolence, impudence, cheek"],"ipa":"/ˈfʁɛçhaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b7/De-Frechheit.ogg/De-Frechheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Frechheit","plural":"Frechheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Was für eine Frechheit!","en":"What a nerve!","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Er hatte die Frechheit, mich um Hilfe zu bitten.","en":"He had the cheek to ask me to help him.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the act of helping"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to ask"}]},{"text":"Er besaß die Frechheit, meinen Rat zu ignorieren.","en":"He had the gall to ignore my advice.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to own, to possess","l":"besitzen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"advice, counsel"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to ignore"}]},{"text":"Er hatte die Frechheit, meinen Rat zu ignorieren.","en":"He had the gall to ignore my advice.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"advice, counsel"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to ignore"}]},{"text":"Toms Frechheit ärgerte mich.","en":"Tom's rudeness made me angry.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to annoy","l":"ärgern"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"}]}]}